---
title: Easy pancakes
servings: 2
tags: [breakfast, quick]
source: https://github.com/cooklang/cookcli
description: Thin crepe-style pancakes for a slow weekend morning.
---

Crack the @eggs{3} into a #blender{}, add the @flour{125%g}, @milk{250%ml} and @sea salt{pinch}, and blitz until smooth.

Pour into a bowl and leave to stand for ~{15%minutes}.

Melt @butter{knob} in a #large non-stick frying pan{} over a medium heat, then tilt the pan so the butter coats the base.

Pour in one ladle of batter and tilt again so that it spreads thinly over the whole base. Cook for ~{1-2%minutes}, until the edges start to come away from the pan.

Once golden underneath, flip and cook for ~{1%minute} more, until cooked through.

Serve straight away with your favourite topping.
